### Run `docker compose up -d --build` first. Sample data is seeded in Development.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Log in as the seeded admin (also: manager@demo.local, reception@demo.local)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@demo.local", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### Sign up a new company (returns a token for its first Admin)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyName": "My Hotel Co", "fullName": "Jane Owner", "email": "jane@myhotel.example", "password": "Sup3rSecret!" }

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hotels (paged, searchable)
GET {{base}}/api/hotels?search=harbour&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rooms (filters: hotelId, type, minCapacity, maxPrice, isActive)
GET {{base}}/api/rooms?minCapacity=2&maxPrice=200
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Availability
GET {{base}}/api/rooms/available?hotelId=HOTEL_ID&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-04&guests=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Guests
GET {{base}}/api/guests?search=jensen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create booking
POST {{base}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": "ROOM_ID", "guestId": "GUEST_ID", "checkIn": "2026-12-01", "checkOut": "2026-12-04", "numberOfGuests": 2 }

### Booking lifecycle
POST {{base}}/api/bookings/BOOKING_ID/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Record a payment (type: Payment | Refund; method: Cash | Card | BankTransfer | Other)
POST {{base}}/api/bookings/BOOKING_ID/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00, "method": "Card", "reference": "Deposit" }

### Invoice
GET {{base}}/api/bookings/BOOKING_ID/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check out (balance must be settled)
POST {{base}}/api/bookings/BOOKING_ID/check-out
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== Public guest booking (no login) =====
@slug = demo-hotels-group

### Hotels of a company
GET {{base}}/api/public/{{slug}}/hotels

### Available room types for a stay
GET {{base}}/api/public/{{slug}}/hotels/HOTEL_ID/offers?checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-04&guests=2

### Book a room type (response contains reference + accessCode; email goes to Mailpit, http://localhost:8025)
POST {{base}}/api/public/{{slug}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hotelId": "HOTEL_ID", "roomType": "Suite", "checkIn": "2026-12-01", "checkOut": "2026-12-04", "numberOfGuests": 2,
  "firstName": "Gina", "lastName": "Guest", "email": "gina@example.com" }

### View own booking
GET {{base}}/api/public/{{slug}}/bookings/BK-REFERENCE
X-Booking-Code: ACCESS-CODE-HERE

### Cancel own booking (until 24h before arrival day)
POST {{base}}/api/public/{{slug}}/bookings/BK-REFERENCE/cancel
X-Booking-Code: ACCESS-CODE-HERE

### ===== Sessions =====
### Swap a refresh token (from login) for a new access + refresh pair; the old refresh token stops working
POST {{base}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "REFRESH_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN" }

### End the session
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "REFRESH_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN" }

### ===== GDPR (Admin/Manager) =====
### Export everything held about a guest
GET {{base}}/api/guests/GUEST_ID/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Erase the guest's personal data (not allowed while a stay is upcoming/ongoing)
POST {{base}}/api/guests/GUEST_ID/anonymize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
